            "src": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/Rending_of_the_veil_by_William_Bell_Scott_%281869%2C_priv.coll%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled",
            "decoding": "async",
